VITE_PRICING_ENGINE_API_URL=http://localhost:4100
VITE_SALLY_API_URL=/api/sally-brain
VITE_SALLY_VOICE_API_URL=/api/sally-voice
VITE_SALLY_VOICE_MODE=tts

# Pricing engine notes:
# - Set VITE_PRICING_ENGINE_API_URL to the configured pricing-engine API base URL for live/demo pricing-engine verification.
# - Leave VITE_PRICING_ENGINE_API_URL blank only for local development; the app will show "Demo pricing mode" and use mock pricing.
# - Mock pricing is development-only and must not be presented as final borrower pricing.
